  "description": "In-game Save/Load info-panel labels in SLPM_86.053 (0x70790-0x70853, two copies). NOT used by the album screen after GAME START (its panel is graphics). Labels concatenate directly with saved values, so retain their colon/space separators. Slot-number and date suffixes are copied two bytes at a time: the slot number gets ': ', date separators use pair-encoded '/', and the day suffix is empty. Static layout reviewed; user screenshots verify populated Load slots 1/2, dates, labels and None/Soccer club values. Save-mode and empty/error/System branches remain unverified. Promoted to normal builds after user testing; see docs/testing.md and docs/game-internals.md section 6i.",
